<h2 id="sec-2">測試方法</h2>
<p>我們在30晚試用期內評估了每款加重毯：全身壓力分佈、整夜溫度調節、材質舒適度和邊緣耐用性。aterial feel and breathability, construction quality including stitching and bead retention, ease of cleaning and maintenance, and subjective sleep improvement reports.</p>
<h2 id="sec-3">各款首選評測</h2>
<h3>1. Gravity Blanket — 最全面首選</h3>
<p>Gravity Blanket由一位尋求幫助兒子緩解焦慮和睡眠問題的父親發明。其專利Gauntlet格紋設計確保均勻重量分佈。透氣編織結構避免熱量堆積，提升睡眠舒適度。還提供多種尺寸選擇。 to choose between cotton and bamboo covers lets you select the perfect temperature regulation.</p>
<div style="background:#F7F4EF;border-left:3px solid #C9A962;padding:1rem 1.25rem;margin:1.5rem 0;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-size:0.95rem"><strong>最適合：</strong> Those with anxiety, restless sleep, or anyone seeking 是行業標竿 in weighted blanket therapy.</p></div>
<h3>2. YnM Cooling — 最佳性價比</h3>
<p>售價不到50美元，YnM Cooling加重毯提供令人矚目的品質。Gauntlet格紋技術防止填充物移位，確保均勻分散重量，防止填充物移位，冷卻罩提升舒適度，使其適合夏季使用。提供多種顏色和尺寸選擇。ights from 5 to 30 pounds.</p>
<h3>3. Bearaby Cotton Square — Best Design</h3>
<p>Bearaby Cotton Square兼具美觀與實用。手工編織有機棉構造創作出 紋理毯面透氣且可機洗。開放式編織設計促進卓越空氣流通，適合怕熱的睡眠者。</p>
<h2 id="sec-4">購買指南</h2>
<p><strong>Choosing the right weight:</strong> A good rule is 10% of your body weight plus 1-2 pounds. For a 150 lb person, a 15-17 lb blanket is ideal. Heavier isn't always better.</p>
<p><strong>Material matters:</strong> Cotton is breathable and durable. Bamboo rayon is softer and cooler. Polyester blends are budget-friendly but less breathable.</p>
<h2 id="sec-5">常見問題</h2>
<h3>加重毯應該多重?</h3>
<p>一般為體重的10%再加1-2磅。 兒童應使用不超過5-7磅的加重毯。</p>
<h3>可以每晚使用加重毯嗎?</h3>
<p>是的，大多數人每晚使用。有些人偏好每週3至4次。聆聽身體的感受最重要。</p>
